            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 10,
              "start": 10
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Ginsburg asked for clarification about the status of the Cubic judgment on appeal to the Ninth Circuit."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "5bfc9393b53c6101b68af1dc76c39b4047267c45795539479d8e5c45a9988f7e",
            "evidence_ids": [
