            "pages": {
              "end": 11,
              "start": 11
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Ginsburg asked why the Cubic judgment has been pending for ten years."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
