            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 12,
              "start": 12
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Ginsburg asked whether Iran could take proceeds out of the United States given the 2007 blocking order."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "5bfc9393b53c6101b68af1dc76c39b4047267c45795539479d8e5c45a9988f7e",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-5bfc9393b53c-0000-0007"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 15,
              "start": 15
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kennedy asked whether the issue before the Iran tribunal is a set\u2011off in the event of a judgment in favor of Iran."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Chief Justice Roberts",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "5bfc9393b53c6101b68af1dc76c39b4047267c45795539479d8e5c45a9988f7e",
