              "start": 23
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Ginsburg, justice Ginsburg questioned whether the issue is moot."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "5bfc9393b53c6101b68af1dc76c39b4047267c45795539479d8e5c45a9988f7e",
